            "faqs_L3Hb8f": {
              "type": "faqs",
              "name": "FAQs",
              "settings": {
                "css_class": "",
                "columns": 3
              },
              "blocks": {
                "accordion_row_z4yYcr": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Are NO2U products backed by science?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_giCdBH": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>Yes! NO2U products are developed using over 25 years of research on Nitric Oxide. They are formulated by Dr. Nathan S. Bryan, a leading expert in the field, ensuring that every product is scientifically tested and effective.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_giCdBH"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_a9CfzL": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "What can I expect to feel after taking nitric oxide?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_D9BUtG": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>After taking nitric oxide, you may experience improved blood flow, enhanced energy levels, and better overall endurance. Many users report feeling more energized and focused shortly after use, though some may not feel the difference right away. Rest assured, it’s still working behind the scenes. Consistent use can yield long-term results, further enhancing your performance and overall well-being.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_D9BUtG"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_wgQnWE": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Do NO2U products contain artificial sweeteners or colors?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_EQ9BG8": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>No! We use natural sweeteners and colors, such as stevia extract and spirulina powder.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_EQ9BG8"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_YHcMzk": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Do you offer bundles or subscriptions?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_XJxT8x": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>Yes! Consistency is key to experiencing the full benefits of Nitric Oxide. We offer bundles and our <a href=\"/pages/subscribe-save\" title=\"Subscribe & Save\">Subscribe and Save</a> program makes it effortless to stay on track while providing significant savings.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
